aspect[6]{value,cards,definition,cardKeys}:
  Aggression,1,"Attack with maximum efficiency and dish out lots of damage. This aspect is a great fit for players who prefer fast-paced, fiery playstyles that break through opponents’ defenses and hurl themselves toward victory at any cost. A leader or base provides aspects; a card in another aspect costs 2 extra resources per icon the leader and base do not provide (aspect penalty).","0101165"
  Command,1,Accelerate your resources and call upon lots of units or strengthen the units you already have in play. This is the aspect of choice for players who want to overwhelm their opponents with a massive board presence. A leader or base provides aspects; a card in another aspect costs 2 extra resources per icon the leader and base do not provide (aspect penalty).,"04010087"
  Cunning,2,"Adapt to any situation on the fly with powerful, immediate effects and lots of tools for disrupting your opponent’s plans. This aspect is a perfect fit for players who prefer to respond quickly to threats and have an answer for anything their opponent could throw their way. A leader or base provides aspects; a card in another aspect costs 2 extra resources per icon the leader and base do not provide (aspect penalty).",0101030|09010218
  Heroism,1,Fight for peace and justice with cards that feature the protagonists of the Star Wars series. This aspect is great for players who want their cards to support and protect each other while pressing the attack. A leader or base provides aspects; a card in another aspect costs 2 extra resources per icon the leader and base do not provide (aspect penalty).,"09010218"
  Vigilance,5,"Play defensively with the ability to heal damage, remove dangerous units from play, and protect your base from enemy attacks. This aspect is perfect for players who like patient playstyles that can endure even the deadliest assaults. A leader or base provides aspects; a card in another aspect costs 2 extra resources per icon the leader and base do not provide (aspect penalty).",0101033|0101070|0101074|04010001|09010004
  Villainy,4,Battle for ultimate power with cards that feature the antagonists of the Star Wars series. This aspect is perfect for players who want to command huge armies or wield powerful destructive effects. A leader or base provides aspects; a card in another aspect costs 2 extra resources per icon the leader and base do not provide (aspect penalty).,0101033|04010001|04010087|09010004
